<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ComicCraft - Ideation Phase</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f0ff;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #292044;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 25px auto;
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px #0001;
    }
    h1 { color: #6d28d9; }
    h2 { color: #4c1d95; }
    button {
      background: #6d28d9;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    #idea { line-height: 1.7; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>🎨 ComicCraft</h1>
    <h2>Phase 1: Ideation Phase</h2>

    <p><b>Project Title:</b> AI Comic Story Creator
      using Gemini Models</p>

    <h3>Project Idea</h3>
    <p>ComicCraft is an AI-powered application that
      helps users create comic stories from text prompts
      using Gemini AI technology.</p>

    <h3>Objectives</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Generate comic stories from user prompts.</li>
      <li>Create engaging story scenes.</li>
      <li>Explore AI-generated comic illustrations.</li>
      <li>Provide a simple user interface.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Proposed Features</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Text prompt input</li>
      <li>AI story generation</li>
      <li>Comic scene presentation</li>
      <li>Story output display</li>
    </ul>

    <button onclick="showIdea()">Explore Project Idea</button>
    <p id="idea"></p>
  </div>

  <script>
    function showIdea() {
      document.getElementById("idea").textContent =
        "ComicCraft transforms creative text prompts into " +
        "comic-style stories using AI. Image generation " +
        "requires a supported AI image service.";
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
